ngh kushwah is a senior ENT and rhinology specialist in New Delhi with over 25 years of clinical and surgical experience. He diagnoses and treats the full spectrum of nose and sinus conditions - from chronic sinusitis and nasal polyps to deviated septum surgery and complex endoscopic skull base procedures - at his clinics in CR Park and Arjun Nagar (Safdarjung Enclave), New Delhi."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mt-5","children":"If you are searching for a nose and sinus specialist in Delhi, CR Park, South Delhi, or anywhere in the NCR, this page will help you understand your condition, your treatment options, and why thousands of patients across India have trusted Dr. kushwah with their nasal and sinus health."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"w-full","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"w-full h-full min-h-[300px] lg:min-h-[450px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 shadow-2xl bg-white/5","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/DrDhirendraSinghKushawh-ENT-Surgeon.webp","alt":"Ear and hearing care by Dr. Dhirendra Singh Kushwah in New Delhi","className":"w-full h-full object-contain"}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-white text-sm","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":16,"height":16,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-shield-alert text-teal-400","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","oel41y",{"d":"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"}],"$L2","$L3","$undefined"]}]," 25+ Years Experience"]}],"$L4"]}]]}]]}],"$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","```jsx","$L9","```jsx","$