f persistent nasal or sinus symptoms. Depending on your symptoms and examination, evaluation may include a nasal examination, nasal endoscopy or other investigations. Treatment may involve medicines, allergy management, nasal procedures or surgery when clinically appropriate."}]}]]}]}]}]
